{
  "file": "module1",
  "page": 241,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        66.30271911621094,
        293.65972900390625,
        84.57271575927734
      ],
      "text": "Randomization and trial procedure",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        91.01463317871094,
        527.3776245117188,
        105.72163391113281
      ],
      "text": "TB CHAMP : All eligible children in a household were treated with the same drug (either all Lfx or all",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        104.47858428955078,
        527.3984985351562,
        118.92158508300781
      ],
      "text": "placebo). Households were randomized (allocated by chance) to be in the Lfx or the placebo group.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        117.67859649658203,
        527.3783569335938,
        132.12159729003906
      ],
      "text": "Allocation conducted by computer, and households had an equal chance of being in either group.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        130.8787384033203,
        527.430419921875,
        145.3217315673828
      ],
      "text": "In this “double blind” study, neither the children (or their family) nor the researchers knew whether",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.07862854003906,
        287.24835205078125,
        158.52162170410156
      ],
      "text": "the tablets each child took were Lfx or placebo.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        165.78260803222656,
        527.392578125,
        180.22560119628906
      ],
      "text": "A CXR (anteroposterior and lateral images) was completed at baseline and, if any evidence of TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        178.9826202392578,
        527.4322509765625,
        193.4256134033203
      ],
      "text": "on the CXR or if the child had any symptoms or signs suggestive of TB, they underwent sampling",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        192.18263244628906,
        527.3827514648438,
        206.62562561035156
      ],
      "text": "for mycobacterial evaluation. IGRA and HIV testing were done in all children at baseline, and the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        205.3826446533203,
        527.3967895507812,
        219.8256378173828
      ],
      "text": "result was required before enrolment of children aged 5–17 years. A pregnancy test was performed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        218.58265686035156,
        527.3648681640625,
        233.02565002441406
      ],
      "text": "at baseline for all female participants who had begun menstruation. A full blood count, alanine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        231.7826690673828,
        527.4306030273438,
        246.2256622314453
      ],
      "text": "transaminase and bilirubin were collected at baseline in all children. Children were followed at 4, 8,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        244.98255920410156,
        527.3853149414062,
        259.4255676269531
      ],
      "text": "12, 16, 24, 48 and 72 weeks and at additional unscheduled visits as clinically indicated. At each visit,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        258.18267822265625,
        527.3969116210938,
        272.6257019042969
      ],
      "text": "children were assessed clinically for symptoms and signs of TB, new exposure to TB and for evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        271.3826904296875,
        527.450439453125,
        285.8257141113281
      ],
      "text": "of any adverse events due to the medication. Adherence to medication was quantified by pill returns",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        284.58270263671875,
        527.4376220703125,
        299.0257263183594
      ],
      "text": "and counts, treatment diaries and questionnaires. Weight and height were measured at each visit,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        297.78271484375,
        527.219970703125,
        312.2257385253906
      ],
      "text": "all concomitant medications documented, and any outpatient or inpatient health-care visits were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        310.98260498046875,
        527.4367065429688,
        325.4256286621094
      ],
      "text": "recorded. The dose of medication was adjusted monthly as necessary. A CXR (AP and lateral) was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.1826171875,
        527.5888061523438,
        338.6256408691406
      ],
      "text": "done at baseline and at 12 and 48 weeks and at any time of clinical concern. Two respiratory samples",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991446495056152,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.3825988769531,
        527.4168090820312,
        351.82562255859375
      ],
      "text": "were collected for mycobacterial evaluation if the child had any symptoms or signs suggestive of TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.5826110839844,
        527.5455322265625,
        365.025634765625
      ],
      "text": "or if they had an abnormal CXR. Sampling for presumed pulmonary TB consisted of induced sputum",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999099731445312,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.7825927734375,
        527.16748046875,
        378.2256164550781
      ],
      "text": "or gastric aspiration in children < 5 years, while children aged ≥ 5 years were encouraged to produce",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.988393783569336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.98260498046875,
        527.3848876953125,
        391.4256286621094
      ],
      "text": "an expectorated sputum sample. Samples for presumed extrapulmonary TB were taken according",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        390.1826171875,
        527.4068603515625,
        404.6256408691406
      ],
      "text": "to the site of disease. All samples were examined by smear microscopy, Xpert MTB/RIF Ultra and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        403.3825988769531,
        527.5968627929688,
        417.82562255859375
      ],
      "text": "mycobacterial culture. Drug susceptibility (first- and second-line drugs) was tested in all mycobacterial",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97697639465332,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        416.5826110839844,
        290.360107421875,
        431.025634765625
      ],
      "text": "isolates by genotypic and phenotypic methods.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.02252197265625,
        527.4266967773438,
        452.7295227050781
      ],
      "text": "V-QUIN : Participants were assigned to parallel groups in a 1:1 ratio in a permuted block design with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.48651123046875,
        527.3051147460938,
        465.9295349121094
      ],
      "text": "varying block size, stratified by province. The allocation sequence was concealed before randomization.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.6864929199219,
        527.3886108398438,
        479.1295166015625
      ],
      "text": "Within a household, participants were placed on the same regimen if enrolled within 90 days of one",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.8865051269531,
        255.2568817138672,
        492.32952880859375
      ],
      "text": "another to avoid a contamination effect.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        499.59039306640625,
        527.4166870117188,
        514.0333862304688
      ],
      "text": "During the 6-month treatment period, participants attended a clinic monthly to assess toxicity and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        512.79052734375,
        527.4055786132812,
        527.2335205078125
      ],
      "text": "support adherence. Patients were also telephoned between scheduled visits, every 2 weeks. After",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        525.9903564453125,
        527.41259765625,
        540.433349609375
      ],
      "text": "treatment, participants attended follow-up sessions for assessment of incident TB with a symptom",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        539.1904907226562,
        527.4317626953125,
        553.6334838867188
      ],
      "text": "screen and CXR at 6, 12, 18, 24 and 30 months. In addition, patients were assessed by telephone",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.390380859375,
        527.5985717773438,
        566.8333740234375
      ],
      "text": "interviews for symptoms every 3 months during the follow-up. Throughout follow-up, participants with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950589179992676,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        565.5903930664062,
        527.5184936523438,
        580.0333862304688
      ],
      "text": "symptoms consistent with TB or CXR abnormalities were asked to produce three sputum samples for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99945068359375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.79052734375,
        527.5643310546875,
        593.2335205078125
      ],
      "text": "Xpert MTB/RIF and liquid culture. After the 30-month follow-up period (up to 134 weeks), participants",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970159530639648,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.990478515625,
        527.4315795898438,
        606.4334716796875
      ],
      "text": "were asked to produce a single sputum sample for Xpert MTB/RIF testing. Those diagnosed with TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.1904296875,
        527.4209594726562,
        619.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "disease were treated with a standard first- or second-line regimen according to national guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        618.390380859375,
        285.2543029785156,
        632.8333740234375
      ],
      "text": "and the drug susceptibility profile – if available.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        643.2570190429688,
        224.97715759277344,
        661.5269775390625
      ],
      "text": "Outcome ascertainment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.9690551757812,
        527.1077270507812,
        682.676025390625
      ],
      "text": "TB CHAMP : The primary end-point for efficacy was incident TB disease (bacteriologically confirmed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 10.995599746704102,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.4329833984375,
        527.5449829101562,
        695.8759765625
      ],
      "text": "or clinically diagnosed) or death from TB at the 48-week study visit after randomization, with a 6-week",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970710754394531,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.6329956054688,
        527.3992309570312,
        709.0759887695312
      ],
      "text": "window allowed, i.e. through week 54. The prespecified main secondary end-point for safety was",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.8328857421875,
        527.4014892578125,
        722.27587890625
      ],
      "text": "adverse events (AEs) grade ≥ 3 assessed by the site investigator as at least possibly associated with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.0330200195312,
        341.16650390625,
        735.4760131835938
      ],
      "text": "the study treatment. Other secondary end-points included:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.7369384765625,
        78.23609924316406,
        757.179931640625
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        742.7369384765625,
        190.2041015625,
        757.179931640625
      ],
      "text": "TB disease by 72 weeks",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        755.9368896484375,
        78.23609924316406,
        770.3798828125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        755.9368896484375,
        167.018310546875,
        770.3798828125
      ],
      "text": "all-cause mortality",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        349.7414855957031,
        801.0170288085938,
        556.0995483398438,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Annex 5. Summary of unpublished studies (PICO 10) 223",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}